{{!-- One text section of a posted item card (item-summary-card.md): a heading over the item's rich text, nothing
when the text is empty. Parameters: label (i18n key), text. A card includes it at the line's start: posted messages
store this HTML, so its indentation is the card's, byte for byte. The heading's class is a name only: cards posted
before it carry a bare <h5>, so no style reads it. --}}
{{#if text}}
      <h5 class="l5r4-item-summary-heading">{{localize label}}</h5>
      <p>
        {{{text}}}
      </p>
{{/if}}
